commit d91ce454b34019b79d1eeb5ee06b23cc7564c2be
Author: Andrew Rusli <arusli@nvidia.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 23 14:22:57 2026 -0700

    [None][fix] Keep the recovery HMAC key out of child processes
    
    load_key() caches the key and scrubs it from the environment at its first call; the authority's fence command gets an environment without it.
    
    FT-off guards:
    FT-on only: the key is read only when peer-loss recovery is enabled.
    
    Signed-off-by: Andrew Rusli <arusli@nvidia.com>

